  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While the myriad tribulation grey memory is still ongoing, birds chirp louder and more often, the sky shines with jade light, and large groups of birds enter formation and charge down. A Heavenly Court Gu Immortal names the assault Myriad tribulation Grand Clear Space.",
      "chapters": [
        1015
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They seem like birds, but the power is space path. Wherever the flying birds go, space is cleared out and nothing can exist there. A Northern Plains predecessor once failed this tribulation yet survived it, then created the immortal killer move three winged green bird from that inspiration; descendants who obtained that move once dominated Northern Plains. The jade flying birds circle Spectral Soul and leave long deep wounds like sharp blades. More than half of Spectral Soul’s thousand arms are chopped off, and his body is covered in wounds, while he does not resist.",
      "chapters": [
        1015
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "space-path-birds",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After grey memory descends, Spectral Soul stands still and allows myriad tribulation grand clear space to assault him until he is covered in countless injuries.",
      "chapters": [
        1016
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-continues",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The myriad tribulation grand clear space finally ends.",
      "chapters": [
        1017
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "assault-continues",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While Fang Yuan watches grey fog scenes around Spectral Soul, narration names the third myriad tribulation as Grand Clear Space. Countless green birds slash at Spectral Soul with terrifying power. The myriad tribulation grand clear space then dissipates as dark oil poison descends.",
      "chapters": [
        1020
      ],
